<title>JAPAN: Orix Corp jumps on 'Big Bang' hopes.</title>
<headline>Orix Corp jumps on 'Big Bang' hopes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Orix Corp jumped on Tuesday afternoon, lifted by hopes that the major leasing company will benefit greatly from Japan's &quot;Big Bang&quot; deregulation plans, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0359 GMT, the shares were up 300 yen at 8,680.</p>
